# Lagos Data School — Project Context

## Stack
- Next.js 14 App Router (NOT Pages Router)
- TypeScript (strict mode)
- Tailwind CSS + shadcn/ui
- Supabase (database + auth + storage)
- Paystack (Nigerian payments in Naira)
- Resend (transactional email)
- Puppeteer (PDF certificate generation)

## Folder Structure
- app/api/          → All API routes (server-side only)
- app/(student)/    → Student pages
- app/(admin)/      → Admin pages
- lib/supabase/     → Supabase client files
- types/index.ts    → All TypeScript types

## Rules
- ALL database mutations go through API routes
- NEVER expose SUPABASE_SERVICE_ROLE_KEY to browser
- NEVER use Pages Router
- Always use TypeScript — no 'any' without a comment
- Use Tailwind CSS for all styling
- Use shadcn/ui for all UI components